00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Sura 71, Noah.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:16.000
[71:1] We sent Noah to his people: "You shall warn your people before a painful retribution afflicts them."

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.000
[71:2] He said, "O my people, I am a manifest warner to you.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:25.000
[71:3] "To alert you that you shall worship GOD, reverence Him, and obey me.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:37.000
[71:4] "He will then forgive you your sins and respite you for a predetermined period. Most assuredly, GOD's appointment can never be delayed, once it is due, if you only knew."

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:41.000
[71:5] He said, "My Lord, I have invited my people night and day.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:44.000
[71:6] "But my invitation only increased their aversion.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:53.000
[71:7] "Whenever I invited them to be forgiven by You, they placed their fingers in their ears, covered themselves with their clothes, insisted, and turned arrogant.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.000
[71:8] "Then I invited them publicly.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:00.000
[71:9] "Then I proclaimed to them loudly, and I spoke to them privately.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.000
[71:10] "I said, 'Implore your Lord for forgiveness; He is Forgiving.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:09.000
Apamea: Should I go ahead read the whole thing?

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.000
Dr. Khalifa: You're the boss.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.000
Apamea: Ok.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.000
[71:11] "'He will then shower you generously with rain.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:19.000
[71:12] "'And provide you with money and children, and orchards, and streams.'"

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:22.000
[71:13] Why should you not strive to reverence GOD?

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:24.000
[71:14] He is the One who created you in stages.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:29.000
[71:15] Do you not realize that GOD created seven universes in layers?

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.000
[71:16] He designed the moon therein to be a light, and placed the sun to be a lamp.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:38.000
[71:17] And GOD germinated you from the earth like plants.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.000
[71:18] Then He returns you into it, and He will surely bring you out.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:45.000
[71:19] GOD made the earth habitable for you.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.000
[71:20] That you may build roads therein.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:55.000
[71:21] Noah said, "My Lord, they disobeyed me, and followed those who were even more corrupted when blessed with money and children.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.000
[71:22] "They schemed terrible schemes.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:05.000
[71:23] "They said, 'Do not abandon your gods. Do not abandon Wadd, Suwaa', Yaghouth, Ya'ooq, and Nasr.'

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:10.000
[71:24] "They misled many. Therefore, let the wicked plunge deeper into loss."

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:17.000
[71:25] Because of their sins they were drowned and assigned to the hellfire. They found no helpers to protect them from GOD.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:22.000
[71:26] Noah also said, "My Lord, do not leave a single disbeliever on earth.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:28.000
[71:27] "For if you let them, they will only mislead your servants and give birth to nothing but wicked disbelievers.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:39.000
[71:28] "My Lord, forgive me and my parents, and anyone who enters my home as a believer, and all the believing men and women. But do not give the disbelievers anything but annihilation."

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.000
Dr. Khalifa: Mã Shã Allãh.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:44.000
Dr. Khalifa: (unintelligible)

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.000
Dr. Khalifa: (unintelligible) Hamid.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:56.000
Apamea: I, I think that this Sura is very clear.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:04:06.000
It, basically, really reminds us what's truly important and what God has given us and what God has provided for us.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:12.000
And a true example of the past, and an entire chapter dedicated to Noah

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:17.000
who lived 950 years, which we're told in one of the chapters.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:21.000
And it's the longest that, that any of the messenger lived.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:26.000
And he was the messenger who came after Adam.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:30.000
And he was with the people for a long period of time.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:36.000
And he was chosen by God to clearly give the message for a long time to the people.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:44.000
And he implored the people so much and tried to teach them and preach to them what's really important.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:51.000
And to basically open their eyes and tell them that this is what God has provided you.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:58.000
And he gives them examples from what's around them, everything that they see, Ok.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:02.000
For instance, what stares at them during the day, which is the sun.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:06.000
And God has created that, like, as a lamp.

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:14.000
And the moon at night, especially when it's full, like last night or whatever, and you cannot miss it, the beauty of it, the light of it.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.000
It just brightens everything.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:23.000
You, I woke up in the middle of the night, last night. I just saw it and it was just through the curtain, my (unintelligible) was just real bright.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:30.000
So here, these creations are placed and, you know, around us.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:36.000
And how blind these people are not to notice that and not to realize it, not to even think about it.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:42.000
Like Abraham did and he looked at the sun and the moon and thought "oh, that was God."

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:46.000
"No." The sun went down and now the moon is up. "That must be God."

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:48.000
"No." You know, so on and so forth.

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:53.000
He seeked and he found because he wanted to find God and God helped him.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:06:00.000
Now, these people are so blind and deaf and they basically just refused any invitation

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:05.000
from Noah and any teachings that he was trying to give to them.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:16.000
And he was telling them "hey, God is Merciful. He will forgive your sins. All you need to do is repent and ask guidance from Him."

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:21.000
And people basically just closed their ears and just covered themselves that they didn't wanna hear it.

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:32.000
However much he insisted, publicly, privately, he did his best and he loudly told them and he quietly told them.

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:36.000
However, he mentioned the message, they wouldn't accept.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:45.000
And this reminds me of a Khutba that we had by Dr. Khalifa and he was giving us the example

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:53.000
in regards to this, the same message that when you see someone going towards a cliff, for instance

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:59.000
and you know that the cliff is present there and the person is gonna fall off of it

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:03.000
and hurt themselves badly or die or whatever, but that person is not aware.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:09.000
First, you inform them when that person is with you like miles and miles away when we can't even see that cliff.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:14.000
You tell them "hey, listen, so many miles away there is a cliff there. Watch out for it."

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:17.000
OK. Then, you just observe the person going that direction.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:22.000
The closer they're getting, it's just because you care about that person. You don't want them to fall off.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:30.000
And then, the closer they're getting, you shout louder and louder and then you just wanna run to them and hold them from falling off.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:33.000
This is clearly what I remember from Khutba and this is what I get, this message

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:38.000
from this Sura that here is this man trying to shake these people.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:45.000
First, he gives them the message and he basically tries to do his best, you know, to carry on the message

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:49.000
and relay it, but these people are just deaf and blind.

00:07:50.000 --> 00:08:02.000
And he tells them that God has created you in stages and He has, this is the most beautiful part. Aya 17, it says

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.000
[71:17] And GOD germinated you from the earth like plants.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:11.000
And this is what I find about the Quran. It's a book of laws.

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:16.000
It's a book... it teaches us about so many things, about the past, the future, the present.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:24.000
And it also has poetry in it and this, this is what really touched me. Also, Aya 16 which is

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:27.000
[71:16] He designed the moon therein to be a light, and placed the sun to be a lamp.

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:31.000
[71:17] And GOD germinated you from the earth like plants.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:36.000
And this is so true because God created us from the, the pottery clay.

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:38.000
And here is a plant that you see every day.

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:43.000
If you have a plant and take care of it and water it, you see how it germinates and how it just basically comes up.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:48.000
And new leaves that you see, it's bright, you know, green and then it turns dark green and it gets bigger.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.000
And this is how we are. We were a baby.

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:57.000
And we grow up and all these beautiful children that we have here. These are all signs from God.

00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:01.000
And again, people are blind to see all these beautiful things.

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:08.000
And God has created this earth and it's, He has made it habitable for us.

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:14.000
And these roads and we see new highways, highways coming, new freeways and

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:17.000
wonderful roads that we have all these buildings on and on and on and on.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:22.000
And these are everything that have, we have been blessed with by God.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:25.000
And He clearly says,

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.000
[71:3] ... obey me.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:33.000
and follow me. Obey God and follow this message and you will be taken care of.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:38.000
You will have a wonderful life, you know.

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:43.000
God will shower you generously with rain. What is rain? It's a sign of bounty.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:49.000
Rain comes and, you know, all the plants grow and we have food.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:59.000
And the money that's provided and the children that we'll have, IN SHAA ALLAH, and orchards and streams, all of these are beautiful.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:05.000
We sit by a stream and we enjoy the beauty of it by the greenery or whatever, anywhere in the nature.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:09.000
So, why shouldn't you, as Aya 13 says,

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.000
[71:13] Why should you not strive to reverence GOD?

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:16.000
Why shouldn't you? These are all these wonderful things that God is promising you.

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:23.000
And these are all the facts that I'm telling you about, the moon and the sun and, you know, how you germinate like plants

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:29.000
and how you are created in stages within the womb and outside as we grow into adulthood.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.000
Why not do it? And again, people wouldn't listen.

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:40.000
So finally, he gets so frustrated and he just turns to God and says in Aya 21,

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:45.000
[71:21] ..."My Lord, they disobeyed me, and followed those who were even more corrupted when blessed with money and children.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:47.000
Here we go, money and children.

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:53.000
We see many examples of this in this society, any society.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:56.000
You think that's the only thing that's important.

00:10:57.000 --> 00:11:00.000
Then, you have children and they become the center of your life.

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:03.000
And you strive so hard for them.

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:11.000
You don't have any rest at all sometimes because you're so working night and day for your children and to money and the greed.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:14.000
And you just basically may forget about God.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:17.000
God willing, we'll always stay on the path that we want.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:28.000
So, he says, God, if these people go on without any retribution, they're gonna keep on being corrupted with money and children.

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:32.000
