00:12:54.000 --> 00:13:01.000
or you go the way of sinfulness and being a disbeliever and idol-worshiping.

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:04.000
And you will deserve hellfire.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:07.000
And so, Noah turns to God and says,

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:10.000
[71:26] ...."My Lord, do not leave a single disbeliever on earth.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:17.000
He really did his best to try to preach to these people and let them know about this good information.

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:21.000
And what will happen, well, if these people stay on,

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:25.000
[71:27] "....they will only mislead your servants and give birth to nothing but wicked disbelievers.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:32.000
