00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:14.000
the servants of God possibly and give birth to nothing but wicked disbelievers.

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:17.000
And the chain will just go on and on and on.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:25.000
And so, he asks forgiveness for himself and his parents and other people who have come to

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:31.000
to, who have come to his home and try to accept, you know, they accepted the word. And

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:33.000
[71:28] ... the believing men and women. ...

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:37.000
