00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:43.000
Basically, just puts it straight.

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:46.000
Annihilation will be awaiting them.

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:50.000
And as we know, the flood came.

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:57.000
Even his wife and son were the disbelievers there among the crowd.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:09.000
And as we learned in the other chapters that God told him, make the ark and you'll have a pair of the animals.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:12.000
And the believers all went with him and they were saved.

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:15.000
And that was God's promise to all these believers.

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:19.000
And so, he told his son, come on with us.

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:27.000
And his son thought that he could be safe on top of whatever it was, top of a some, someplace high.

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:30.000
And he thought that he could be safe from this flood.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:34.000
But the, the flood came and destroyed everything.

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:38.000
And Noah and the believers were all saved.

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:45.000
So, this, I, I think that this Sura was very self-explanatory, very direct, poetic in some areas.

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:51.000
And basically, put us in touch with our creation.

